{"unit_id":"GreenJenckens__dsh-plugin-opencode-limits#card-zh","repo":"GreenJenckens/dsh-plugin-opencode-limits","commit":"474042431d71ef31501bcd1b499816c6522cdfbb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"OpenCode Go Limits for DeepSeek Harness 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的用量显示插件，在对话输入框下方的 composer dock 注册统计 pill。主机端使用已配置的 OpenCode Go 密钥定时读取订阅用量，并通过本机路由向界面提供数据；界面显示 5 小时、每周和每月窗口的剩余百分比及重置时间，点击可立即刷新。适合希望在聊天时查看 OpenCode Go 额度余量的用户。需要 OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY 或 DSH 凭据存储中的对应密钥，并连接 opencode.ai 用量接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:13-25","lib/index.js:21-26","lib/index.js:87-109","lib/client.js:217-288","lib/client.js:296-307"]}
